{{!-- The Warden's mark on an item they wrote notes on (`system.wardenNotes`): the notes are on
      the item's Warden tab, and nobody else's row draws this. --}}
<span class="cairn-item-tag cairn-warden-notes-tag" data-tooltip="{{localize 'CAIRN.WardenNotes.RowHint'}}"
    aria-label="{{localize 'CAIRN.WardenNotes.RowHint'}}"><i class="fa-solid fa-note-sticky" inert></i></span>
